B.Na=new A.b6("tasbeeh-5","Tahlil 100 Times Daily","Equal to freeing 10 slaves & protection from Shaytan",u.M,u.x,u.n,"Sahih Al-Bukhari 3293 | Sahih Muslim 2691",100,"Whoever says this 100 times in a day will have the reward of freeing ten slaves, 100 good deeds written, 100 bad deeds wiped away, and it will be a shield for him from Satan that entire day.","https://www.duaandazkar.com/audio_new/CH7DUA5.mp3",B.YH)
