B.SD=new A.fA(B.VN,"Doubts About Invalidating Wudu","\u0644\u064e\u0627 \u064a\u064e\u0646\u0652\u0635\u064e\u0631\u0650\u0641\u0652 \u062d\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0651\u0649 \u064a\u064e\u0633\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0639\u064e \u0635\u064e\u0648\u0652\u062a\u064b\u0627 \u0623\u064e\u0648\u0652 \u064a\u064e\u062c\u0650\u062f\u064e \u0631\u0650\u064a\u062d\u064b\u0627","According to scholarly consensus and IslamQA (#8918), pure doubts or intrusive thoughts (*waswas*) do not invalidate your Wudu.\n\nThe Prophet \ufdfa established the golden rule: **Certainty is not overturned by mere doubt.** A person should remain in their prayer or state of purity until they are absolutely certain (e.g., they distinctly hear a sound or perceive an odor).\n\n\u2022 **Invalidators of Wudu**: Natural discharges from either passage, deep sleep where consciousness is lost, eating camel meat (Hanbali), or direct touching of the private parts without barrier.","Sahih al-Bukhari 137 | Sahih Muslim 361 | IslamQA #8918","prayer","Check Prayer Times",B.dj)
B.W3=s(["forget","sahw","sujood sahw","missed rakah","doubt rakah","mistake in prayer"],t.s)
B.SA=new A.fA(B.W3,"Sujood as-Sahw (Prostrations of Forgetfulness)","\u0625\u0650\u0630\u064e\u0627 \u0634\u064e\u0643\u064e\u0651 \u0623\u064e\u062d\u064e\u062f\u064f\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0641\u0650\u064a \u0635\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0627\u062a\u0650\u0647\u0650 \u0641\u064e\u0644\u0652\u064a\u064e\u0628\u0652\u0646\u0650 \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0627\u0633\u0652\u062a\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0646\u064e","If you doubt how many rak'ahs you have prayed (e.g., 3 or 4), base your prayer on **what is certain**\u2014which is the lesser amount\u2014complete the prayer, and perform two prostrations (*Sujood as-Sahw*) before or after Tasleem (IslamQA #11244).\n\n\u2022 **Before Tasleem**: If you omitted a mandatory act (like the first Tashahhud) or had a doubt without being able to decide.\n\u2022 **After Tasleem**: If you mistakenly added something (like an extra rak'ah) or resolved your doubt with strong certainty.","Sahih Muslim 571 | IslamQA #11244","prayer","View Prayer Guide",B.dj)
B.UW=s(["fasting mistake","ate by mistake","drank water by mistake","break fast","forget fast","drops","inhaler"],t.s)
B.SG=new A.fA(B.UW,"Eating or Drinking by Mistake While Fasting","\u0645\u064e\u0646\u0652 \u0646\u064e\u0633\u0650\u064a\u064e \u0648\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0648\u064e \u0635\u064e\u0627\u0626\u0650\u0645\u064c \u0641\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0643\u064e\u0644\u064e \u0623\u064e\u0648\u0652 \u0634\u064e\u0631\u0650\u0628\u064e \u0641\u064e\u0644\u0652\u064a\u064f\u062a\u0650\u0645\u064e\u0651 \u0635\u064e\u0648\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0647\u064f \u0641\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0651\u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0623\u064e\u0637\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0647\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0642\u064e\u0627\u0647\u064f","If you accidentally eat or drink out of forgetfulness while fasting, **your fast remains 100% valid and complete**! (IslamQA #22960).\n\nThe Prophet \ufdfa said: *'Whoever forgets that he is fasting and eats or drinks, let him complete his fast, for it was Allah Who fed him and gave him drink.'*\n\n\u2022 **Eye/ear drops & asthma inhalers**: The Islamic Fiqh Academy and major contemporary scholars ruled that medical inhalers and non-nutritive eye drops do not invalidate the fast because they do not constitute food or drink.","Sahih al-Bukhari 1933 | Sahih Muslim 1155 | IslamQA #22960","fasting","Open Fasting Tracker",B.dj)
B.TS=s(["tawbah","repent","forgive","major sin","despair","guilt","lost","addiction"],t.s)
B.SH=new A.fA(B.TS,"The Door of Sincere Repentance (Tawbah)","\u0642\u064f\u0644\u0652 \u064a\u064e\u0627 \u0639\u0650\u0628\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u064a\u064e \u0627\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e \u0623\u064e\u0633\u0652\u0631\u064e\u0641\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649\u0670 \u0623\u064e\u0646\u0641\u064f\u0633\u0650\u0647\u0650\u0645\u0652 \u0644\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0646\u064e\u0637\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0645\u0650\u0646 \u0631\u064e\u0651\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0629\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650 \u06da \u0625\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0651 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064e \u064a\u064e\u063a\u0652\u0641\u0650\u0631\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064f\u0651\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0628\u064e \u062c\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0639\u064b\u0627","Never despair of the mercy of Allah, no matter how severe your sins may seem! Allah\u2019s mercy encompasses everything.\n\nScholars of IslamQA (#14289) explain the **3 Conditions of Sincere Tawbah**:\n1. **Immediate Cessation**: Stop committing the sin right away.\n2. **Deep Regret**: Sincere remorse in your heart for violating Allah's boundary.\n3. **Firm Intention**: A steadfast resolve never to return to it.\n*(If the sin wronged another person, returning their right or seeking their forgiveness is a 4th condition)*.","Surah Az-Zumar 39:53 | IslamQA #14289","duas","Read Sayyidul Istighfar",B.dj)
B.Ye=s(["zakat calculation","nisab","gold zakat","silver zakat","401k","stocks","cash zakat"],t.s)
B.SJ=new A.fA(B.Ye,"Zakat Nisab & Wealth Purification","\u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0642\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u064e\u0651\u0644\u064e\u0627\u0629\u064e \u0648\u064e\u0622\u062a\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0632\u064e\u0651\u0643\u064e\u0627\u0629\u064e \u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0631\u0650\u0636\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064e \u0642\u064e\u0631\u0652\u0636\u064b\u0627 \u062d\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064b\u0627","Zakat is obligatory on every Muslim whose net wealth exceeds the **Nisab threshold** for one full lunar year (*Hawl*).\n\n\u2022 **Nisab Standard**: Equivalent to **85 grams of pure gold (24k)** or **595 grams of silver**.\n\u2022 **Payable Rate**: **2.5%** on qualifying assets: liquid cash, bank accounts, physical gold/silver, trade inventory, and vested retirement balances/shares.\n\u2022 Debts due immediately and everyday personal necessities (house, personal car, clothes) are excluded from the calculation.","Surah Al-Muzzammil 73:20 | IslamQA #50801","zakat","Open Zakat Calculator",B.dj)
